OL,3,ABurnham tells young people EU deal "is
OL,4,Afor you" as Badenoch criticises it as
OL,5,Aunfair
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK and EU agree a new deal covering
OL,8,Ffood exports, youth mobility and carbon
OL,9,Femissions - but talks on student
OL,10,Ftuition fees will continue
OL,12,FBurnham calls it a "historic moment",
OL,13,Fsaying people in the UK want a "better
OL,14,Fdeal" with the EU than the "hard Brexit
OL,15,Fwe ended up with"; President of the
OL,16,FEuropean Commission Ursula von der
OL,17,FLeyen says it's a "big success"
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
